flowchart TB
    U[用户] --> FE[emergence-fe\nNext.js / React]
    FE -->|/api/v1| API[emergence-backend API\nGo / Gin]

    API --> PG[(PostgreSQL\n用户/知识库/文档/状态)]
    API --> M[(MinIO\n原始文档)]
    API --> PW[Go Parse Worker]

    PW --> PC[pkg/parser兼容客户端]
    PC -->|当前优先| W[mytao-emer API\nP012解析切片引擎]
    PC -.->|旧接口fallback| LEG[emergence-parse-server]
    W --> PC
    PC --> S[(文档切片)]

    S --> PI[PageIndex树]
    S --> IW[Go Index Worker]
    IW --> EMB[Embedding服务]
    IW --> ES[(Elasticsearch)]

    FE --> SEARCH[搜索/问答API]
    SEARCH --> ES
    SEARCH --> PI
    SEARCH --> RR[Reranker]
    SEARCH --> QA[LLM问答 + 会话记忆]
    QA --> FE